+            "Different tools help with different parts of the work. The DHS Equity Analysis Toolkit helps you examine a decision, affected people, evidence and options. Check current DHS policy and the Toolkit user guide, and consult the person or area responsible or your equity director about whether an Equity Scan or another required analysis applies. A learning activity does not replace that process.",
